# Wave W17-AD (Amber Sea — Central): garden rock — a taller garden boulder standing in the shipped sea, bright faces up where the garden light hits it, foam collar at its base (design: the crossing’s islets stand taller over the gardens). Central’s own rock — split from West’s low wash-rounded stone by stance entire and from Maris’s tower-isle rock by face: this boulder is bright-faced and tall, a garden marker, not a shore stone.
